{"id":1698,"mal_id":1698,"title":"Nodame Cantabile","englishTitle":"Nodame Cantabile","title_english":"Nodame Cantabile","alternative_titles":{"synonyms":[],"en":"Nodame Cantabile","ja":"のだめカンタービレ"},"synopsis":"Shinichi Chiaki is a first class musician whose dream is to play among the elites in Europe. Coming from a distinguished family, he is an infamous perfectionist—not only is he highly critical of himself, but of others as well. The only thing stopping Shinichi from leaving for Europe is his fear of flying. As a result, he's grounded in Japan.\n\nDuring his fourth year at Japan's top music university, Shinichi happens to meet Megumi Noda or, as she refers to herself, Nodame. On the surface, she seems to be an unkempt girl with no direction in life. However, when Shinichi hears Nodame play the piano for the first time, he is in awe of the kind of music she creates. Nevertheless, Shinichi is dismayed to discover that Nodame is his neighbor, and worse, she ends up falling head over heels in love with him.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]","synopsis_es":"Shinichi Chiaki es un músico de primer nivel cuyo sueño es tocar entre las élites de Europa. Proveniente de una familia distinguida, es un perfeccionista infame; no sólo es muy crítico consigo mismo, sino también con los demás. Lo único que impide a Shinichi partir hacia Europa es su miedo a volar. Como resultado, está castigado en Japón.\n\nDurante su cuarto año en la mejor universidad de música de Japón, Shinichi conoce a Megumi Noda o, como ella misma se refiere, a Nodame. En la superficie, parece ser una chica descuidada sin dirección en la vida. Sin embargo, cuando Shinichi escucha a Nodame tocar el piano por primera vez, queda asombrado por el tipo de música que ella crea. Sin embargo, Shinichi queda consternado al descubrir que Nodame es su vecino y, peor aún, ella termina enamorándose perdidamente de él.\n\n[Escrito por MAL Rewrite]","type":"TV","media_type":"tv","status":"finished_airing","averageEpisodeDuratio